WEBVTT

00:06:58.169 --> 00:07:04.614
Now I live in the United States
as a free person.

00:07:04.638 --> 00:07:05.773
(Applause)

00:07:05.797 --> 00:07:07.314
Thank you.

00:07:07.338 --> 00:07:11.256
(Applause)

00:07:12.113 --> 00:07:14.224
And recently,

00:07:14.248 --> 00:07:18.307
the leader of the free country,
our President Trump,

00:07:18.331 --> 00:07:21.485
met with my former god.

00:07:23.177 --> 00:07:27.894
And he decided human rights
is not important enough

00:07:27.918 --> 00:07:31.146
to include in his agendas,